# Hotel PMS — local development

**Inherits:** monorepo root `.cursor/rules/`. Port **3201** — `npm run dev` (`docs/ECOSYSTEM_URLS.md`).

## Stack

Next.js App Router: `app/` (UI) + `app/api/` (Route Handlers). Prisma: `prisma/schema.prisma`. Services: `src/lib/services/`.

## Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm run dev` | Dev server :3201 |
| `npm run db:migrate` / `db:push` | Prisma schema |
| `npm run db:seed` | Demo data |

## Env (satellite)

`DATABASE_URL`, `ERA_SATELLITE_ORGANIZATION_ID`, `ERA_HOTEL_GUEST_MDM_STRICT` (prod: `true`), `CONTROL_PLANE_URL`, `ORCHESTRATOR_URL`, `SATELLITE_EVENT_SERVICE_TOKEN`, `ERA_SSO_SHARED_SECRET`, JWT/cookie secrets.

## i18n

`messages/{az,ru,en}.json` + `@era/i18n-common`. New UI strings: all three locales.

## Auth

- Staff: `POST /api/auth/login` (local)
- Management: SSO `/sso/callback` from orchestrator launcher
